su name tools be map def
su name javascript tool be interpret ob text code as wo javascript can
prah

exists su name helper be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" via discourse "You must call tools. Use the JavaScript tool to compute math. Return only the tool result." ya
be write ob text "Write a JavaScript program that computes the 1000th prime number using a loop (no libraries). It must print the result using console.log. Return only JavaScript source, no fences." for name helper to name text helper-out with name tools do
ob name helper-out be write do
